{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Or if a person touches.</b> [Referring to] the carcass of the four mentioned, which are the swine and its counterparts." "<b>Or the carcass of an unclean beast.</b> For eating, such as the dog and the donkey and an unclean creeping thing, from the eight mentioned." "<b>And it is hidden from him.</b> And afterward he knows, or he touched a zav, or was defiled by a corpse, and a zavah and a menstruant."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:39.131612148Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}